  "_comment_modname_voidvanguards": "虚空先锋卫队",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.cosmosdimension": "你当前不在宇宙维度中。",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.generatedcosmosgate": "已生成高斯传送门。",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.generatefollowingheads": "你可以生成以下头颅：",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.headnameexistget": "头颅名“%s”不存在。你可以使用以下命令获取所有可用头颅列表：",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.originallocationsave": "原始location不在存档数据中。",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.removedtags": "已移除全部 %s 标签。",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.returnedoriginallocation": "已返回原始location。",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.skyship.entered_orbit.1": "你隐约瞥见了高空中某物，它似乎正稳定地环绕着这颗星球运行。",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.skyship.entered_orbit.2": "  也许你可以用望远镜更仔细地观察它？",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.skyship.explosion": "你突然看见一股能量从舰船上猛烈爆发！",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.skyship.left_orbit": "一切又恢复了正常。该物体必定已脱离其轨道。",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.skyship.lost_focus": "当你对天空舰船的注意力逐渐涣散，其细节也随之消散。",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.skyship.more_detailed": "你越靠近观察这艘船，就越能发现更多细节。",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.skyship.reset": "天空舰船可见性已被重置。",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.skyship.server_trigger": "%s 目睹了天空中的一场爆炸！",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.teleportedvoidbornbase": "已传送至虚空弃子基地。",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.unablereturnplayer": "无法将玩家传送回原始位置。",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.usageheadlist": "用法：/%s head list",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.usageheadname": "用法：/%s 头颅 <name> <amount>：",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.vanguards.cosmos.initial.1": "你好 %s。",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.vanguards.cosmos.initial.10": "……我们正在失去%s……",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.vanguards.cosmos.initial.11": "...不，这不可能... ...防御阵位...",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.vanguards.cosmos.initial.12": "...在你身后...",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.vanguards.cosmos.initial.2": "我们一直在轨道上观察你的行动，并已知晓你注意到了我们。",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.vanguards.cosmos.initial.3": "哦，那场爆炸？别担心，我们都安全脱险了。但这也是你被派来此处的原因之一。",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.vanguards.cosmos.initial.4": "你正身处我们的总部，距离你称之为家的地方仅有数光分之遥。",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.vanguards.cosmos.initial.5": "不过，或许该做个自我介绍了。",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.vanguards.cosmos.initial.6": "我们是先锋卫队——位面与虚空的探索者，时间与空间的守护者。",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.vanguards.cosmos.initial.7": "你目睹的爆炸，正是敌人为消灭我们而持续进行的行动之一。",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.vanguards.cosmos.initial.8": "正如你所见，此举并未奏效；但%s绝不会罢休，直至我们彻底消亡。",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.vanguards.cosmos.initial.9": "我们需要你做的是……",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.vanguards.home.initial.1": "你环顾四周——回到了先前所在的位置。",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.vanguards.radio.coordinates.1": "你必须摧毁位于以下坐标的基地：",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.vanguards.radio.coordinates.2": " %s",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.vanguards.radio.initial.1": "%s?",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.vanguards.radio.initial.10": "准备就绪后，请前往以下坐标：",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.vanguards.radio.initial.11": "%s",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.vanguards.radio.initial.12": "进入传送门，并摧毁基地边缘的雷达。",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.vanguards.radio.initial.13": "小心行事。待任务完成后，我自会与你相见。",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.vanguards.radio.initial.14": "祝你好运，通话结束。",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.vanguards.radio.initial.2": "你安全吗？",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.vanguards.radio.initial.3": "我很高兴能把你从站点带离。",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.vanguards.radio.initial.4": "我们遭到了袭击，情况十分艰难……",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.vanguards.radio.initial.5": "宇宙中时间流逝的方式截然不同。自我们相遇以来，已过去了一周。",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.vanguards.radio.initial.6": "……如今，我们的数量更少了。我们已将逝者安葬。",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.vanguards.radio.initial.7": "我有一事相求。",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.vanguards.radio.initial.8": "我们探测到一处由 %s 支持者运营的前进基地。",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.vanguards.radio.initial.9": "在那座基地彻底瘫痪前，我不能再冒险进行传送了。",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.vanguards.voidbornBase.1": "%s，你成功了。",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.vanguards.voidbornBase.2": "雷达被摧毁后，我们得以突破%s的防御。",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.vanguards.voidbornBase.3": "很高兴你没有信守他们的虚假承诺。",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.vanguards.voidbornBase.4": "此举对遏制他们永恒黑暗的推进而言，是一次极其关键的胜利。",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.vanguards.voidbornBase.5": "接下来交给我们处理，我这就送你返回宇宙传送门。",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.vanguards.voidbornBase.6": "感谢你的英勇无畏，我很快会与你联系。",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.vanguards.voidbornBaseDestroyed.1": "你为我们及整个世界立下了巨大功劳。",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.vanguards.voidbornBaseDestroyed.2": "目前%s威胁已暂时解除，我们将转向另一个象限。",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.vanguards.voidbornBaseDestroyed.3": "我想把这个送给你：",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.vanguards.voidbornBaseDestroyed.4": " > 你获得了轨道应答器",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.vanguards.voidbornBaseDestroyed.5": "它赋予你随心所欲在该星球与先锋空间站之间传送的能力。",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.vanguards.voidbornBaseDestroyed.6": "你可以按喜好改造它，但请确保其功能正常——我们可能还会再次用到它。",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.vanguards.voidbornBaseDestroyed.7": "祝你未来历险顺利。",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.vanguards.voidbornBaseDestroyed.8": "指挥官%s已下线。",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.voidborn.attacked.1": "啊！你选择了暴力。",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.voidborn.attacked.2": "如你所愿。愿此地成为你的葬身之所。",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.voidborn.attacked.3": "虚空弃子！攻击！",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.voidborn.attacked.4": "～ 拒绝了邀请，你仍需找到雷达并将其禁用！～",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.voidborn.base.breakblock.unable": "某种神秘力量正阻止你破坏方块。",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.voidborn.base.placeblock.unable": "某种魔法力量正阻止你放置方块。",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.voidborn.base.radarLever.flip": "你扳下拉杆，无视所有安全协议。雷达发出嘶嘶声，你强行执行硬关机。",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.voidborn.base.radarLever.flip.unable": "雷达已损坏，拉杆卡死。",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.voidborn.base.radarSign.text.0": "！雷达控制",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.voidborn.base.radarSign.text.1": "必须存放在",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.voidborn.base.radarSign.text.2": "上方位置",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.voidborn.base.radarSign.text.3": "始终生效！",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.voidborn.cosmos_gate.enterSuccess.again": "一种熟悉的被扭曲感充斥着你的脑海。",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.voidborn.cosmos_gate.enterSuccess.first": "当你进入传送门时，你感到自身存在正穿越时空而扭曲。",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.voidborn.cosmos_gate.enterUnable": "某种魔法力量正阻止你进入传送门。",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.voidborn.cosmos_gate.mobsAround": "传送门周围现存的虚空弃子阻止你进入！",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.voidborn.endAsteroid.1": "你已回到虚空弃子的小行星基地。",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.voidborn.endAsteroid.2": "希望你做出了正确的抉择。",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.voidborn.givenradio.1": "你做出了正确的选择。",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.voidborn.givenradio.2": "给我一点时间来追踪他们的location。",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.voidborn.givenradio.3": "我即将启动传送。",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.voidborn.givenradio.4": "出发吧，如何？",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.voidborn.initial.1": "停下！请立刻停下！",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.voidborn.initial.10": "你只需把那台收音机递给我即可。",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.voidborn.initial.11": " ~ 你可以选择发动攻击，或对虚空领主身上的轨道无线电右键点击。抉择权在你手中。 ~ ",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.voidborn.initial.2": "你已证明自己足够胜任。",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.voidborn.initial.3": "杀死我们毫无意义。",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.voidborn.initial.4": "我们自虚空而生，亦将再度崛起。",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.voidborn.initial.5": "然而，若我们能达成某种协议，双方皆可从此情形中获益。",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.voidborn.initial.6": "我能感知到你身上残留着轨道无线电的痕迹。",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.voidborn.initial.7": "有了这个，我可以追踪先锋的location。",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.voidborn.initial.8": "...并且我们可以摆脱他们。",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.voidborn.initial.9": "这座基地、这颗小行星及其所有财富都将归你所有。",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.voidborn.vanguardStation.1": "%s？你来这里做什么？",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.voidborn.vanguardStation.10": "接下来交给我们吧。",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.voidborn.vanguardStation.11": "尽情享受这颗小行星吧。",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.voidborn.vanguardStation.2": "虚空弃子的雷达已被摧毁了吗？",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.voidborn.vanguardStation.3": "你……是怎么来到这里的？",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.voidborn.vanguardStation.4": "...不，这不可能...",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.voidborn.vanguardStation.5": "你好，莉拉。",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.voidborn.vanguardStation.6": "那台无线电设备是一件极为实用的装备。",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.voidborn.vanguardStation.7": "能成为你的对手，实乃荣幸之至。",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.voidborn.vanguardStation.8": "现在是时候终结这一切了。",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.voidborn.vanguardStation.9": "谢谢你，%s。",
